From: Note FE port (egemengunel/ios-a5xelte, branch gracerlte, 76abd2e), merged for the S7
Subject: [PATCH] Note FE patches 0401-0470 on top of the S7's 0341

The Galaxy Note FE port (same Exynos 8890, built on this S7 port at 0331) as one patch over 0332-0341: its kernel
patches 0401 and 0403-0470, merged three ways (base: the S7 tree at 0331, from the 0341 CI build tree with 0332-0341
reversed). Left out for the S7: 0400 (the Note FE's panel at 0xd8000000; the S7's is 0xe2a00000) and 0402 (that
chip's ASV voltages, 12-37 mV above the S7's table). Conflicts resolved:
  herolte_battery.c  the bus's third slave: our lock and fg_addr (0339, the motor at 0x66) carry the Note FE's
                     charger (0x69, 0406/0411: the charger's watchdog cleared, its input limit raised)
  herolte_gpu.c      hg_run(): the GPU's interrupt (0415) when attached, else our asleep polling (0333/0334)
What it brings (boot-args as in the Note FE port): backlight service and brightness by pixel scaling (0418-0420,
notefe_bl=1 default), charger watchdog (herochgwdt, default on), load governor (herogov=1), herocap, GPU interrupt
waits (herogpuirq, default on), Bluetooth over UART1 (0432-0436, through sysctl kern.notefe_bt), front camera S5K4E6
(0437-0468), IOSurface plane row (0464), oslog to the console (herolog=NAMES), sandbox fixes (0410/0412),
the zero-copy display (0425-0431, off by default: notefe_zc=0).
